 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Natsu No Owari Ni Kimi Ga Shineba Kampekidattakara"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "夏の終わりに君が死ねば完璧だったから"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A boy living in the countryside, Eto Hinata has no hope for his future due to his poor family environment. Then Tsumura Yako, a college student suffering from “Gold Disease,” a fatal disease that turns the body into gold, appears before him and offers him an inheritance of a body that can be sold for 300 million yen after death. When confronted with an overwhelming amount of money, are his feelings for her real?\n\nThis is a magnificent and sad story of one summer's love.",
   "ja": "片田舎に暮らす少年・江都日向は劣悪な家庭環境のせいで将来に希望を抱けずにいた。そんな彼の前に、身体が金塊に変わる致死の病「金塊病」を患う女子大生・都村弥子が現れ、“死後３億円で売れる死体”の相続を持ちかけてくる。\n圧倒的な大金を前にしたとき、彼女への想いは本物なのか？　壮絶で切ないひと夏の愛の物語。"
  },
